# Web routes & UI expectations

## Public routes (must exist / stay wired)

`/`, `/learn`, `/courses/:slug`, `/trading-floor`, `/trading-floor/:slug`, `/projects`, `/projects/:slug`, `/volt-society`, `/about`, `/blog`, `/contact`, `/login`, `/register`, `/terms`, `/privacy`, `/risk-disclosure`.

## Dashboard areas

Overview · Learn (my courses / library / progress / certificates) · Trading Floor (explore / my investments) · Accounts (wallet, transactions) · Projects · Volt Society · Notifications · Support · Settings/Profile.

## CTA language (prefer)

Start Learning · Buy Course · Enter Trading Floor · Explore Opportunity · Invest Now · View Portfolio · Deposit · Withdraw · Join Volt Society.

## UX notes

- Responsive desktop/tablet/mobile; dashboard usable on mobile (drawer/bottom nav ok).
- Cards, tables, filters, progress, badges, modals, toasts, empty states, skeletons.
- Spec PDF suggests premium dark fintech; **current shipped brand is light cream + Volt gold** — preserve the established design system unless explicitly asked to rebrand.
- Never invent guaranteed-return marketing copy on opportunity or portfolio UI.
